  "details": "turns main screen green, shuts it off (or resets) and then the BIOS screen shows up\n\nfirst encountered on 06/11/2024 08:39:31 (while VJing)\n\nthen when starting vrchat on 09/11 06:30 (did not create a dump file so uncertain)\n\nthen at 09/11/2024 11:27:06 in a small instance with friends\n\nat least the last crashdump file indicates it is caused by an adress in EAC\n\nthe crashdumps were pulled with bluescreenview (and since i cannot upload zipes they are here) https://drive.google.com/file/d/1QLipTb6S-lMyVVUI6dhhAKPh5k4FueR2/view?usp=sharing",
